id: pm-rust-context-activity-utf8
title: Decode readable UTF-8 replacement in retained context activity
description: "A scratch tracker with a valid history row containing an invalid UTF-8 byte inside its quoted message reproduces a separate retained-activity mismatch. Published pm-cli 2026.11.18 runs context --depth standard --json with exit 0 and includes the replacement character in the activity row. Native exits 2 because src/orientation_context/sections.rs::activity_entries uses the strict history reader. Round FU covers the independent focus and idle history read."
type: Task
status: open
priority: 3
tags[3]: follow-up,history,orientation
